## 5. UI & Controls you’ll probably need

| Need | MapLibre solution | Library (optional) |
|------|-------------------|--------------------|
| Zoom + compass | `new maplibregl.NavigationControl()` | built-in |
| Scale bar | `new maplibregl.ScaleControl({maxWidth:200, unit:'metric'})` | built-in |
| Attribution | `new maplibregl.AttributionControl({compact:true})` | built-in |
| Layer switcher (checkbox list) | Write a small HTML `<input type="checkbox">` that toggles `map.setLayoutProperty(layerId,'visibility',…)` | **maplibre-gl-layer-switcher** (npm) |
| Full-screen button | `new maplibregl.FullscreenControl()` | built-in |
| Geocoder / search | **MapLibre GL Geocoder** (`@maplibre/maplibre-gl-geocoder`) | npm |
