| **5** | Port event listeners (`click`, `mouseover`, etc.) to `map.on('event','layer-id',handler)`. |
| **6** | Replace Leaflet pop-ups with `new maplibregl.Popup()`. |
| **7** | Add any MapLibre UI controls you need (`new maplibregl.NavigationControl()`, `Scale
